WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.702 --> 00:00:03.871
- WHAT DO WE DO?

00:00:03.904 --> 00:00:06.039
THEY TOLD US AT THE STATION
TO COME DOWN HERE AND FILL TIME,

00:00:06.073 --> 00:00:09.176
BUT, UH, THERE'S
NO STORY HERE.

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:11.545
- IN THIS NEIGHBORHOOD,
THERE'S ALWAYS A STORY.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:14.047
HERE, GIMME THE NAME
OF A MYTHICAL CREATURE.

00:00:14.081 --> 00:00:15.215
- MYTHICAL CREATURE?
I DON'T--

00:00:15.249 --> 00:00:17.084
- TRUST ME.
- UH, I DON'T--A PEGASUS.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.285
- PEGASUS, PERFECT.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:22.723
JUST ROLL,
WATCH, AND LEARN.

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.091
- THEY CAN STAY IN MY HOUSE
IF THEY WANT TO--

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.326
- HI, THERE. RICK NICHOLSBY,
CHANNEL SIX NEWS.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.428
WE'VE HAD REPORTS
OF A PEGASUS IN THE AREA.

00:00:28.462 --> 00:00:29.897
HAS ANYBODY SEEN
ANYTHING LIKE THAT?

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.965
- AW, YEAH, MAN,
I SEEN A PEGASUS.

00:00:31.999 --> 00:00:34.801
I SEEN IT, YEAH, EVERY DAY.
- I SEES IT TOO, MAN.

00:00:34.835 --> 00:00:36.370 line:0%
 
WE BOTH SEE
THAT PEGASUS, DOG.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:38.438 line:0%
 
- YEAH, I SAW IT
WITH MY OWN TWO EYES, MAN.

00:00:38.472 --> 00:00:40.274 line:0%
 
THAT HORSE HAD
A BIG OLD SNAKE HEAD--

00:00:40.307 --> 00:00:42.943 line:0%
 
- NAW, MAN, IT AIN'T
GOT NO SNAKE HEAD, FOOL.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:45.179 line:0%
 
Y'ALL, THAT--THAT HORSE
HAD SOME BIG WINGS, MAN.

00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:46.246 line:0%
 
- YEAH, YEAH.
- THAT'S SOME FLYING [bleep].

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.848 line:0%
 
- YEAH, THAT HORSE
HAD BIG OLD WINGS.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.683 line:0%
 
MAN, LIKE TWO
SETS OF WINGS, YEAH.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.418 line:0%
 
Y'ALL SEE THE PEGASUS?
all: YEAH.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.820 line:0%
 
- EVERYBODY UP IN HERE
SEEN THE PEGASUS, MAN.

00:00:53.854 --> 00:00:56.256
- CURIOSITY HAS
BROUGHT OUT LARGE CROWDS

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:59.526
TO SEE THE ALLEGED PEGASUS IN
THIS SOUTH LENNOX NEIGHBORHOOD.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:00.627
- LOOK, THERE IT IS.

00:01:00.661 --> 00:01:04.231
- I'M GONNA FIND IT,
BREAK IT,

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:06.700
AND THEN RIDE IT
TO THE PEGASUS TREASURE.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.803
- RESIDENTS SAY THE CREATURE
RESEMBLES THIS AMATEUR SKETCH.

00:01:09.837 --> 00:01:11.405
- KICKED THE [bleep]
OUT OF MY CAR.

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:13.207
CITY'S GOTTA PAY
FOR THAT [bleep] TOO.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.342
I AIN'T GOT NO COVERAGE
FOR NO PEGASUS, BITCH.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.743
- HE LAND ON MY ROOF, MAN.
LOOK AT MY ROOF, MAN.

00:01:16.777 --> 00:01:17.678
HE BUSTED IT UP.

00:01:17.711 --> 00:01:19.479
HE BUSTED
THE WHOLE THING UP, MAN.

00:01:19.513 --> 00:01:21.682
YEAH, HE BEEN--HE BEEN--HE BEEN
SITTING UP THERE EVERY DAY.

00:01:21.715 --> 00:01:23.517
- WHILE MANY REVEL
IN THE POSSIBILITY

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:25.085
OF SEEING
THE WINGED HORSE,

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:27.588
OTHERS ARE NOT
SO WELCOMING.

00:01:27.621 --> 00:01:30.123
- I JUST KNOW THIS NEIGHBORHOOD
WOULD BE BETTER

00:01:30.157 --> 00:01:32.359
IF THAT PEGASUS
IS PUT DOWN.

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:35.829
- I TELL YOU THIS: GOD AIN'T
PUTTING NO WINGS ON NO HORSE.

00:01:35.863 --> 00:01:38.565
- NOW, SEE, IF THIS WAS
A WHITE NEIGHBORHOOD,

00:01:38.599 --> 00:01:40.734
ANIMAL CONTROL
WOULD BE UP IN HERE

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.536
WITH A PEGASUS TRAP.
- THAT'S RIGHT.

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:46.473
THEY CAN'T TAKE OUR PEGASUS.
THIS IS OUR PEGASUS.

00:01:46.507 --> 00:01:47.875
- PEGASUS UP IN
THIS MOTHER[bleep]!

00:01:47.908 --> 00:01:49.343
- HEY, MAN, WHY YOU
INTERRUPTING ME?

00:01:49.376 --> 00:01:50.978
I'M TRYING TO TALK
ABOUT THE PEGASUS.

00:01:51.011 --> 00:01:52.246
- [bleep] YOU!
- HEY!

00:01:52.279 --> 00:01:55.215
DON'T BE DISRESPECTING PEGASUS!
- I LOVE PEGASUS!

00:01:57.718 --> 00:02:00.621 line:0%
 
- YES, WE'RE HERE LIVE
ON THE SCENE IN SOUTH LENNOX,

00:02:00.654 --> 00:02:03.824 line:0%
 
WHERE RIOTS HAVE BROKEN OUT
OVER THE ALLEGED APPEARANCE

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:05.592 line:0%
 
OF A FLYING HORSE.

